# Prose documents are checked by review, not by a formatter.
*.md
# Shell scripts have no Prettier parser; the container entrypoint is reviewed as
# the bash it is (scripts/visual-baseline-entrypoint.sh).
*.sh
# Generated AI-surface text: no Prettier parser, and the content is produced by
# scripts/generate-llms.mjs, which `llms:check` verifies byte-for-byte.
apps/docs/public/llms.txt
apps/docs/public/llms-full.txt
# The published registry payload (ADR-007) is build output written by
# scripts/build-registry-payload.mjs. It is formatted JSON, but reformatting it is
# meaningless: `rmSync` regenerates it byte-for-byte, so a Prettier pass would
# either be a no-op or, worse, a diff that the next build undoes. Same reason
# `packages/core/registry/` is ignored.
apps/docs/public/registry/
